---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
---

<div class="why-build-copy editorial-content">
  <p>
    I like being involved in the full process: figuring out what needs to be built, designing it, shipping it, and keeping it running. Working across different technical domains has taught me how to adapt quickly and think beyond just code. I thrive when collaborating with and guiding teammates and clients to bring shared goals to life.
  </p>
  <p>
    I’m continuously expanding my skillset through hands-on experience with both products and people. Helping turn ideas into real, working systems while learning something new every day is what keeps me moving forward in this field.
  </p>
  <nav class="why-build-ctas" aria-label="About page shortcuts">
    <Button href="/skills" variant="primary">
      My Experience <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </Button>
    <Button href="/projects" variant="primary">
      Things I've Built <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </Button>
  </nav>
</div>

<style>
  .why-build-copy {
    gap: 0.95rem;
  }

  .why-build-copy p {
    max-width: none;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .why-build-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .why-build-ctas :global(.button) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    min-height: 3.1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .why-build-ctas {
      width: 100%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .why-build-ctas :global(.button) {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 3.1rem;
      padding: 0.64rem 0.7rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
  }
</style>
